1876	/****************************************************************************
1877	 * Name: netpkt_copyin
1878	 *
1879	 * Description:
1880	 *   Copy 'len' bytes of data from a buffer into the netpkt, starting at
1881	 *   'offset' of netpkt.
1882	 *
1883	 * Input Parameters:
1884	 *   dev    - The lower half device driver structure
1885	 *   pkt    - The net packet
1886	 *   src    - The source buffer
1887	 *   len    - How many bytes to copy
1888	 *   offset - The offset of netpkt to put the data
1889	 *
1890	 * Returned Value:
1891	 *   0:Success; negated errno on failure
1892	 *
1893	 ****************************************************************************/
